# ---------------------------------------------------
# Third-party / re-downloadable content
#
# Pattern from a prior project: if content is licensed and can't be
# redistributed, or is free-but-large and re-downloadable from its source
# (a marketplace pack, a sample-project import), ignore it here and add a
# row to a Docs/AssetSources.md documenting what it is and where to get it
# back on a fresh clone. Don't let this section stay empty by default if
# the project pulls in any paid/marketplace content - an empty exclusion
# list here on a real project usually means someone forgot, not that
# there's nothing to exclude.
#
# Example entries (uncomment/adapt once real paths exist):
# Content/SomeMarketplacePack/
# Content/SampleProjectImport/
